CDavBookingSelectionPermissionsHelp=These permissions are independent and disabled by default. Consecutive slots within one day are combined only when enabled; breaks and day changes remain separate appointments. To offer adjacent slots, choose a start interval that divides the base duration, for example 30 minutes for 60-minute slots.
