CDavBookingValidityHelp=These optional dates limit appointment dates, with both bounds included, in the collaborator’s time zone. Matching dates allow just one day. Leaving both dates empty gives the profile no validity limit. The booking horizon remains separate: for example, only the next six months are offered when that horizon is chosen. Minimum notice still applies.
