CDavBookingValidityFrom=Appointments offered from %s.
CDavBookingValidityUntil=Appointments offered through %s inclusive.
CDavBookingValidityEmpty=No appointment dates are currently open for this profile. Contact the collaborator if needed.
CDavBookingTimingHelp=The appointment and both margins must fit within one working range, without crossing a break. Start times follow the chosen interval from the beginning of each range; this interval is independent of the appointment duration. Minimum notice is elapsed time: 1,440 minutes means 24 hours and can exclude all slots on the current day.
CDavBookingWeeklyTooShort=No slots can be offered with these working hours, even when the calendar is empty. The appointment and its margins need at least %s continuous minutes within one range; the start-time interval must also be respected. Extend a range, reduce the duration or margins, or adjust the interval. This warning does not prevent saving the profile.
